{"code":"093920","name":"서원인텍","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"핸드셋","sector_desc":"휴대폰 부품·완제품. 주요 고객사의 신제품 출시 사이클을 따라 움직입니다.","desc":"동사는 1983년 설립, 2007년 코스닥 상장 후 베트남 하노이에 법인을 운영하며 2024년 코론을 인수해 사업 확장함. 삼성전자 1차 벤더로 휴대폰 키패드, Flip Cover 등 Accessory를 공급하고, 초정밀 고속가공기, CNC방전가공기를 개발·생산하여 두산공작기계 등에 공급하고 있음. 베트남 공장을 활용해 원가경쟁력을 확보하고, 국내 고속가공기 시장 점유율 90%를 기반으로 해외시장 진출을 적극 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":4630.0,"open":4695.0,"high":4780.0,"low":4505.0,"volume":12426,"amount":57532380.0,"ret_1d":1.3129,"gap":2.7352,"range_pct":5.9395,"ret_5":-0.5371,"ret_20":-5.317,"ret_60":-5.0256,"ret_120":-11.4723,"ret_250":-17.9078,"ma20":4745.5,"ma60":4821.1667,"ma120":4853.8333,"ma200":4974.15,"close_vs_ma200":-6.9188,"close_vs_ma60":-3.9652,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-12.8623,"r2_60":0.2231,"slope_120":-9.5191,"r2_120":0.1947,"slope_250":-17.3123,"r2_250":0.7772,"high52":5750.0,"low52":4500.0,"pos_52w":10.4,"dd_52w":-19.4783,"mdd_1y":-20.3316,"atr14_pct":3.2243,"vol_ann_60":16.7175,"vol_avg20":12231.3,"vol_ratio20":1.0159,"vr5":0.7299,"vr20":0.5506,"amount_avg5":40757535.0,"amount_avg20":57898785.75,"amount_avg60":55872452.1667,"obv_chg20":-68.8373,"turnover_20":1.3152,"pv_eff_20":-4.0427,"rsi14":36.7882,"frgn_net_5":-5221.0,"inst_net_5":526.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0281,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0028,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0252,"frgn_net_20":13599.0,"inst_net_20":1884.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0731,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0101,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0832,"frgn_net_60":56069.0,"inst_net_60":19509.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.3014,"inst_net_60_pct":0.1049,"smart_net_60_pct":0.4063,"frgn_net_120":54417.0,"inst_net_120":22058.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.2926,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1186,"smart_net_120_pct":0.4112,"foreign_ratio":3.59,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.18,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":12.0,"op_margin_q":2.746,"op_qoq":20.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-66.6667,"rev_yoy":-15.9615,"op_trend_4q":20.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":4.58,"debt_ratio":15.23,"per":8.84,"pbr":0.4,"di